window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Is blood thicker than water?<br> Do loyalties only stay within the confines of the family?<br> Bobby and Tilly’s relationship has dealt with enough hardship. From Bobby’s crutch with drugs, to ease the pain of time, as he thought Tilly’s heart ceased to beat forever. To Tilly’s over-bearing parents moving into town, relentlessly manipulating her to move back home and forget about The Afton Adders. Their relationship was already tested by her near-death experience; will it fortify against the storms that arise? Or will it wither and die?<br> <br> They find their fate isn’t decided by them, but by another.<br> <br> Tropes:<br> - MMF<br> - Why choose?<br> - Gangster/Mafia romance<br> - \"Crawl to Me\"<br> - Morally Grey<br> - Dark Romancy<br> - She goes from Bubblegum to Blackcat<br> - Peaky Blinder and Dramoine inspired<br> - Knife play<br> - Powering through Judgmental Parents</p> <p>TW: <br> - Self harm <br> - Parental abuse <br> - Mentions of SA</p>"; 
